still-true native lifecycle integration
---------------------------------------
Luné V0.16 vendors MIT-licensed files from the user's fork
https://github.com/liyanjun921/still-true at revision
f58d6f38fa6a0c3c3acb502af2d63ccb17b81484.
Copyright (c) 2026 Rumi, Rune, Serein. See
backend/vendor/still_true/LICENSE and SOURCE.json for pinned file hashes.
The native living_context.py, today_state.py, hint_snapshots.py and tools.json
implement the original lifecycle. The sole vendored source adaptation is a
Windows import fallback for file locking; host code adds four scoped stores,
canonical current-turn evidence for model writes, authenticated owner UI,
private audit metadata and session receipts. An expired item does not imply
the real-world event ended.
